| **Command**    | **What it does**                            |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `nmap target`  | Scans a host or network for open ports.     |
| `whois domain` | Retrieves domain registration information.  |
| `tcpdump`      | Captures and analyzes network packets.      |
| `wireshark`    | Graphical packet analyzer (launch command). |
| `hydra`        | Password auditing and login testing tool.   |
| `john`         | Password hash cracking tool.                |
| `hashcat`      | GPU-accelerated password recovery tool.     |
| `aircrack-ng`  | Wireless network security testing suite.    |
| `sqlmap`       | Automated SQL injection testing tool.       |
| `msfconsole`   | Launches the Metasploit Framework console.  |
